<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Anadarko started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Anadarko started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--ABN Amro Chicago Corp on Friday said it initiated coverage of Anadarko Petroleum Corp with a buy rating on the stock.</p>
<p>--The firm's earnings estimates for the international independent oil-exploration company are for $1.84 a share in 1997 and $2.23 in 1998.</p>
<p>--Anadarko Petroleum ended off 5/8 at 52-1/2.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
